.TH QUIPU-NAMESPACES-APPLY-IF 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-namespaces\-apply\-if \- Conditionally apply an exact configured owner\-local namespace declaration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu namespaces apply\-if\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIrequest.json\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Conditionally apply an exact configured owner\-local namespace declaration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIrequest.json\fR>

